    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a complicated relationship with mathematics. While I recognize its importance, especially in fields like economics that interest me, I find it challenging and often feel overwhelmed by abstract concepts. My dislike for math stems from my school experiences where it felt rigid and impersonal, contrasting with subjects like biology where I could see practical applications more clearly.",
